Landed as Gerrit change 1603 (commit 059906539d), MERGED with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1, 0 unresolved comments.

Delivered tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_cloud_outbound_status_routing_6194.py (3 tests, test-only; git show --stat confirms 1 file changed, nothing under src/):
- status never appears as an ACLI flag in the workitem edit argv while the co-submitted --summary survives;
- transition_issue is dispatched exactly once (so dropping status on the floor does not satisfy the guard);
- a status-only update spawns no ACLI subprocess at all and returns {key, status}.

Falsifiability checked: temporarily changing acli.update_issue's kwargs.pop("status") to kwargs.get("status") makes 2 of the 3 tests FAIL; reverted and all 3 pass. make lint and make typecheck pass from the worktree venv.
